OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of 2,000-year-old bog body
OL,4,Asolved in 'first of its kind'          
OL,5,Ainvestigation                          
OL,7,FFor more than 2,000 years, the remains 
OL,8,Fof an Iron Age woman lay undiscovered  
OL,9,Fin bogland - her story unlikely to ever
OL,10,Fbe told.                               
OL,12,FBut when archaeologists unearthed human
OL,13,Fbones in 2023, it led to an            
OL,14,Funprecedented effort in Northern       
OL,15,FIreland to find out who they belonged  
OL,16,Fto - and what had happened to that     
OL,17,Fperson.                                
OL,19,FNow a coroner's investigation has been 
OL,20,Fheld at the Ulster Museum in Belfast to
OL,21,Festablish the truth behind the         
OL,22,FBallymacombs More Woman.               
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
