OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of 2,000-year-old bog body
OL,4,Asolved in 'first of its kind'          
OL,5,Ainvestigation                          
OL,7,FIt has established that she was between
OL,8,F15 to 22 years old when she died - and 
OL,9,Fthat she suffered a deliberate         
OL,10,Fdecapitation, most likely inflicted    
OL,11,Ffrom behind with a bladed weapon.      
